"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"bD6n"}]},{"client_msg_id":"c42f6d97-afba-45ca-8ccc-31c668914410","type":"message","user":"UERCTTT8B","text":"ああ、元のか","ts":"1617896489.014600","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"W1MdP"}]},{"client_msg_id":"7b8b23b7-9948-4484-b957-c04a7350676d","type":"message","user":"UERCTTT8B","text":"たとえ *A と *B に共通のメソッドがあったとしても呼べないと思いますね","ts":"1617896482.014400","thread_ts":"1617896482.014400","reply_count":1,"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"FlJW"}]},{"client_msg_id":"027ddce1-d0ef-4451-9f96-da54a307d922","type":"message","user":"UGXMRNBUM","text":"複数型が指定されてたら、無条件で `interface{}` じゃなくて\nもとの宣言時の型が引っ張ってこられるっぽいなァ","ts":"1617896452.013800","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"vFZd"}]},{"client_msg_id":"2ac48e06-2034-4cf4-8e96-e23a14db3d21","type":"message","user":"U06BRP8VD","text":"明記はされてないけど、例示はされてるなぁ。\n\n\u003chttps://golang.org/ref/spec#TypeSwitchStmt\u003e","ts":"1617896448.013500","thread_ts":"1617896448.013500","attachments":[{"fallback":"The Go Programming Language Specification - The Go Programming Language","id":1,"title":"The Go Programming Language Specification - The Go Programming Language","title_link":"https://golang.org/ref/spec#TypeSwitchStmt","text":"Go is an open source programming language that makes it easy to build simple, reliable, and efficient software.","blocks":null,"service_name":"golang.org","service_icon":"https://golang.org/favicon.ico","from_url":"https://golang.org/ref/spec#TypeSwitchStmt","original_url":"https://golang.org/ref/spec#TypeSwitchStmt"}],"reply_count":1,"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"WxV4"}]},{"client_msg_id":"a43a7bf8-3967-4394-ab88-9b1b0dc77153","type":"message","user":"UDDCM376D","text":"語弊かもだけど、コンパイル時の型と実行時の型が異なるのって型チェックのタイミングで弾かれているという理解で合っていますか？","ts":"1617896355.011800","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"QbU2"}]},{"client_msg_id":"12f7b0f4-130c-48f5-a72b-1c81c5f60ebe","type":"message","user":"UGXMRNBUM","text":"これがIになるんだとしたら、任意の条件を満たすインターフェイスXに勝手に判断されうる気がするけど、そんな賢かったっけ…\n宣言時の型を引っ張る何かが作用してるんだろうか？？？？","ts":"1617896242.009800","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"YimEr"}]},{"client_msg_id":"f5f946ea-f830-4654-b86a-885892ae6365","type":"message","user":"U06BRP8VD","text":"あとSSA考えると最初の switch の `*B` のcaseは決して通らないパスでもあるので最適化でコードは落ちてるかもしれない。","ts":"1617896241.009700","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"fDa"}]},{"client_msg_id":"2e3b085b-66ba-4c97-a5b3-f54d9632fe13","type":"message","user":"U06BRP8VD","text":"コンパイル時の型ではないので。","ts":"1617896178.008000","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Hdw"}]},{"client_msg_id":"d302024f-d63d-4534-a977-daf488134730","type":"message","user":"UDDCM376D","text":"あーーーー","ts":"1617896178.007900","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"AMbcZ"}]},{"client_msg_id":"5a379637-6686-4580-8d02-419aecba1061","type":"message","user":"U06BRP8VD","text":"それは実行時の型であって","ts":"1617896168.007400","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"I=C"}]},{"client_msg_id":"909a13b0-6302-4441-b497-41b4bfa6668d","type":"message","user":"UDDCM376D","text":"```\tswitch i := a.(type) {\n\tcase *A, *B:\n\t\tfmt.Printf(\"%T\", i)\n\t}```\nこれで `*main.A` が出力されるから、 F がないって怒られるのがよくわからない…","ts":"1617896132.007100","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"sL+qZ"}]},{"client_msg_id":"a617c9d2-ac44-48b6-96cf-fd8f73a6eaa2","type":"message","user":"UERCTTT8B","text":"複数型が指定されてたら無条件で interface{} かな。","ts":"1617896070.006000","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"10/uJ"}]},{"client_msg_id":"ccb38cde-dacd-4b85-9ed6-fa63c03cb44e","type":"message","user":"UERCTTT8B","text":"そんな賢く共通項を見つけてくれるとは思えない","ts":"1617896050.005500","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"sorena","count":1,"users":["U06BRP8VD"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Uv+F"}]},{"client_msg_id":"d4ffd470-a271-47ae-9882-7bff1e8f1bcd","type":"message","user":"UERCTTT8B","text":"interface{} だとおもいました","ts":"1617896044.005100","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"sig1"}]},{"client_msg_id":"9d20d684-795e-4f68-b8d0-7903824c1e5f","type":"message","user":"U06BRP8VD","text":"ただおそらくこれ `interaface{}` じゃないかなぁ","ts":"1617896006.004600","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"l2twM"}]},{"client_msg_id":"96ce5748-6f30-4154-a6e8-300ff0b6e7f7","type":"message","user":"UDDCM376D","text":"なんで型が I になるのかがわからない…","ts":"1617895975.004100","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"789U"}]},{"client_msg_id":"188e5474-1928-4240-9d5a-c170b8ad49d5","type":"message","user":"U06BRP8VD","text":"`case *A, *B:` は `I` 型でされるからフィールド `F` は見つけられないってはなし?","ts":"1617895959.003600","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"tvGz"}]},{"client_msg_id":"d81dc96a-441d-45f9-8ea7-e6084cd1251b","type":"message","user":"UNJ2DANJC","text":"Cだったらいけそうな雰囲気（ちがう","ts":"1617895901.002700","edited":{"user":"UNJ2DANJC","ts":"1617895912.000000"},"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"d